      "name": "Mass Rejuvenation",
      "category": "defensive",
      "text": "This functions similarly to a lich's rejuvenation ability, though with all the liches of a legion returning as a troop thanks to a collective Soul Cage, which is a level 18 item that has Hardness 15 and 54 Hit Points.",
